{
  "bodyHash": "k/JYNG5wlZk=",
  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">必要依賴模組：</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">Epic Fight（作者：maninthe_home）</span></strong></em></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Weapons of Miracles（作者：reascer）</strong></em></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/to-tweaks-irons-spells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>T.O Magic 'n Extras（作者：GameTechBC）</strong></em></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-invincible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Epic Fight - Invincible（作者：P1nero）</strong></em></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Epic Fight: Resurrection（作者：Corrupt_Dog）</strong></em></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">強烈推薦：</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-t-o-magic-n-extras-armors-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>EF x T.O Magic 'n Extras - 盔甲修復材質包（作者：本人）</strong></em>（主要修復盔甲胸甲部位隱形問題）</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>2025年9月14日：立即加入我們的Discord：</strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>展示影片：（版本 1.3.0）<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0hKi1NRPJuo?si=BJL1xilSEI41khPe\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>展示影片：（版本 1.1.0.a）</strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XbbOTGxEvuA?si=z_ul-NvWEG-_E_v3\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>展示影片：（已過時：版本 1.0.4）</strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wVCaeAwQMaI?si=pWIw1pB457fgb94H\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">模組介紹：</span></strong></p>\n<p>你沒有看錯，這就是<strong>Epic Fight x T.O Magic 'n Extras&nbsp;</strong>！內含大量動作組，讓你徹底碾壓敵人！</p>\n<p>這些動作組將為你的模組包帶來充滿樂趣的冒險與遊戲體驗...</p>\n<p><strong>更重要的是...</strong>本次動作組的特別之處在於：其中<strong>8組動作</strong>可透過<strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">法術攻擊觸發連擊</span></strong>（此功能基於EF - Invincible開發，可觀看影片了解操作方式）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">完整連擊操作指南：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">開始前請注意：以下為我使用的全部連擊按鍵配置（可透過「選項/控制.../按鍵綁定」頁面滾動調整）（左鍵與右鍵實際對應滑鼠左右鍵）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_9b5c411d-ccb1-48db-aa80-8eee51754571.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"794\" height=\"202\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">最新版本：1.1.0（亦稱 1.1.0.a）</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>全新固有技能：&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>*註：* = 乘法</em></strong></p>\n<p>*已重製</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">永恆閃電之水</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">- 自體導電衝鋒</span> <strong>(KEY3 + KEY1)</strong>：在自身位置召喚閃電，然後衝鋒（向前）突破（1.5倍傷害），以水之力擊倒敵人（消耗1層 / 冷卻時間：10秒）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_a33166af-0c02-4a5e-876a-1934d7bb3936.png\" width=\"193\" height=\"180\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_e2865a47-b3c4-4579-9ae0-c278b051c316.png\" width=\"182\" height=\"182\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_3b0f87dc-51b5-4243-979b-a066dc909d73.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"182\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 潮汐斬擊 (KEY1_2，同時按下滑鼠左鍵與右鍵)：揮出水之斬擊造成更高傷害，被擊中的生物獲得潮濕效果（無法竊取魔力）&nbsp;(消耗2層 / 冷卻時間16秒)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_e04811f0-696d-4cc8-8b11-328c67db1c99.png\" width=\"198\" height=\"210\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_f4b36b60-b465-4894-a0f8-323e1e27554c.png\" width=\"314\" height=\"211\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_c5ab4924-3ba3-4d88-bc6c-66593f7daae2.png\" width=\"235\" height=\"211\"></span></p>\n<p><strong>潮汐斬擊傷害可受以下加成：</strong>&nbsp; * (屬性) 水系法術強度、攻擊傷害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 輝煌雷暴 (KEY4)：憤怒閃電的強化版，召喚強大閃電打擊附近敵人，創造向前推進的海嘯並持續雷暴15秒（消耗3層 / 冷卻時間：35秒）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_15054bc8-f605-4288-a50e-683f3c86d1d4.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"223\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_999ce74b-fecc-4913-8506-8c62509338d1.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"220\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_bfd342bd-8ced-40e9-a7c5-6bd121cf62a8.png\" width=\"288\" height=\"220\"></span></p>\n<p><strong>海浪實體傷害可受以下加成：&nbsp; </strong>* (屬性) 水系法術強度、攻擊傷害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">*新增：&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">沙塵暴覺醒：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 踐踏連擊 (組合技)：完成所有普通攻擊(KEY1)後按下KEY3發動衝刺踐踏打擊，再按KEY1發動2段左側踐踏連擊（冷卻時間：10秒 / 消耗1層）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_f267c70e-878c-4e86-bf14-c8013f5ba814.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"228\"><strong style=\"color:#808080\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_07b380ba-fa1e-449b-8afa-389739fe565f.png\" width=\"259\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_03548913-7c53-4584-a058-8469e89ea293.png\" width=\"212\" height=\"225\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>踐踏範圍傷害可受以下加成：&nbsp;</strong>* (屬性) 自然法術強度、攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 沙漠風暴斬擊者 (KEY1_2/ 同時按下滑鼠左鍵與右鍵)：旋轉攻擊向前發射小型沙塵暴（冷卻時間：15秒 / 消耗：1層）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_58cd7fc8-60f0-473f-a702-40682ccd2846.png\" width=\"260\" height=\"213\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_ddc96c08-c7b4-4c41-b4dc-85ca9e85b1b7.png\" width=\"221\" height=\"212\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_954f5feb-8bb8-4cea-a703-d140ff86fb80.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"212\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">沙塵暴投射物傷害可受以下加成： </span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">* (屬性) 神聖/自然法術強度，災變配置：沙塵暴傷害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 環繞沙暴 (KEY3)：怒吼使附近敵人暈眩，創造3個沙塵暴環繞自身旋轉，持續15秒（冷卻時間：35秒/ 消耗2層）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_623adb30-5c98-4b91-a62c-78c501d0b8ab.png\" width=\"260\" height=\"207\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_4c5e2b70-3e82-4025-a1b6-ce377a6ada19.png\" width=\"198\" height=\"206\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_696166e1-d5f9-4c09-b1c5-7a4f05a511d9.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"205\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">沙塵暴實體傷害可受以下加成：</span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> * (屬性) 神聖/自然法術強度、攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 石碑隕落 (KEY4)：快速橫掃攻擊，在頭頂8格範圍內召喚多重遠古沙漠石碑環狀落下，持續造成巨額傷害（冷卻時間：25秒 / 消耗3層）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_79b346a2-0c52-412a-ba8b-f4090d710dac.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_81d3d98d-e15e-4481-a6fb-12f0043b3871.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"231\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_b84af9fd-c6df-4fd1-821a-82fae5bf6ac5.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"229\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">遠古石碑傷害可受以下加成：&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">* (屬性) 神聖/自然法術強度、攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">煉獄核心：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 熔岩炸彈 (KEY3)：發射熔岩炸彈，撞擊地面時爆炸留下小型熔岩池（冷卻時間：7.5秒 / 消耗1層）</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_abe96d72-ffdf-454a-bca2-14933d11bac7.png\" width=\"224\" height=\"216\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_b8fb7f0f-8a9a-4ec1-81a7-dba3c7f40efd.png\" width=\"203\" height=\"216\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_39f2b514-1a64-4fb0-86cc-b03762d26891.png\" width=\"188\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 地動山搖 (組合技：KEY1_2/同時按下右鍵與左鍵 + KEY2 + KEY2)：重擊地面在附近創造多重火焰噴射，造成高傷害並附加燃燒效果（無冷卻 / 消耗1層，總消耗：2層）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_94d26f65-887c-4114-90aa-c82b1a9b9820.png\" width=\"189\" height=\"194\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_73fc668e-5bf1-4b19-be18-346147e00bdd.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"195\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_0dbfcf10-cf66-4004-b099-04a209f9d0d1.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"194\"></p>\n<p><strong>火焰噴射傷害可受以下加成：&nbsp;</strong>*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (屬性) 火焰法術強度，T.O MnE配置：&nbsp;</span></p>\n<pre>WeaponConfig:infernalDevastatorBlazingSalvoDamageMultiplier</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 地獄迴旋斬 (KEY4)：橫掃攻擊創造向前推進的火環斬擊，被擊中生物獲得熾焰真空效果（3秒後觸發並召喚環繞火焰噴射）（冷卻時間：15秒 / 消耗2層）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_5ef177e5-679e-4e6a-89f8-3acce9e2ce1d.png\" width=\"211\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_3aa4252e-5e9f-4c29-a241-31fc957ae2b5.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_05ee4d8e-0b6e-464c-b0c6-5f727e1677d8.png\" width=\"188\" height=\"182\"></p>\n<p><strong>迴旋斬傷害可受以下加成： </strong>*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (屬性) 火焰法術強度、攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">煉獄火山：</span></strong></p>\n<p>- 三重熾焰 (組合技)：完成所有普通攻擊連擊後，按下KEY2（3次）發動3段連擊，每段發射一枚熾焰炸彈（無冷卻 / 消耗1層）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_335a4962-e3b5-4746-9acb-537aa7c0ab1a.png\" width=\"243\" height=\"215\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_bd17d29b-ea95-431c-8527-520127606a50.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"215\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_656c594e-0fce-4f4e-b5f2-87e3b2eed1ad.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"214\"></span></p>\n<p><strong>火焰噴射傷害可受以下加成：&nbsp;</strong>*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (屬性) 火焰法術強度，T.O MnE配置：&nbsp;</span></p>\n<pre>WeaponConfig:infernalDevastatorBlazingSalvoDamageMultiplier</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 三重爆裂射擊 (KEY3)：發射3枚熔岩炸彈（冷卻時間：10秒 / 消耗1層）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_d7b53bfb-4a9f-4bd4-b76a-786ec6b11441.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"208\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_953fb68e-81e9-4351-8098-f60194319be9.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 岩漿噴發 (KEY4)：地動山搖強化版，創造短暫地震並召喚大量環繞火焰噴射（冷卻時間：25秒 / 消耗3層）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_06a20a23-acb5-464e-abfc-a9418add8ab3.png\" width=\"211\" height=\"244\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_e059c692-397f-49a7-899f-224d32e07347.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"244\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_83ec4f40-e7f7-4f98-8c31-0f06d6af05cb.png\" width=\"274\" height=\"245\"></span></p>\n<p><strong>火焰噴射傷害可受以下加成：&nbsp;</strong>*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (屬性) 火焰法術強度，T.O MnE配置：&nbsp;</span></p>\n<pre>WeaponConfig:infernalDevastatorBlazingSalvoDamageMultiplier</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>地震範圍傷害可受以下加成： </strong>*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (屬性) 火焰法術強度、攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">夜幕降臨：</span></<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">滅絕雙拳套：</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">滅絕<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">對決&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_26d10e95-254b-431d-ba4c-05b2d873d52b.png\" width=\"340\" height=\"321\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_7d14ef6f-2a8a-43be-be0d-7225f3f7b1e7.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"320\"></p><p><strong>按鍵 4（按下 H）</strong></p><p>- 抽出另一隻拳套，對敵人<strong>噴射火焰</strong>並<strong>召喚隕石墜落</strong>（持續時間：10秒）<strong>（冷卻時間：30秒）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>奧利維恩之刺：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>自然癒合</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>按鍵_1_2（同時按下左鍵與右鍵）</strong></span></p><p>- 簡單賦予你再生效果 2（8秒）與橡木皮膚效果 3（15秒）（冷卻時間：15秒）</p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>蔓延根鬚</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_481a17c1-d2a7-4dad-a872-addb6406a9d6.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"274\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_5c37861e-1303-4f14-baa3-a50214a0d124.png\" width=\"308\" height=\"273\"></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">按鍵 3（按下 X）</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>設置陷阱</strong>，於<strong>3秒後</strong>生長出根鬚，<strong>捕捉範圍內所有生物（施法者除外）</strong>並<strong>困住它們 10秒（冷卻時間：20秒）</strong></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>地震</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_254949a6-6e04-41c1-9e72-0242a1da5551.png\" width=\"468\" height=\"315\"></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">按鍵 4（按下 H）</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 跳躍並重擊地面，引發<strong>半徑 10格範圍內的地震</strong>，<strong>擊倒</strong>敵人並造成<strong>巨額傷害（冷卻時間：45秒）</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>虛空打擊收割者：</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">終界狂怒</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">按鍵_1_2（同時按下左鍵與右鍵）</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 你的狂怒使附近敵人暈眩，並在<strong>10秒內</strong>對敵人造成<strong>額外 30% 傷害</strong></span>（冷卻時間：25秒）</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">漩渦風暴：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_1d57f1a8-5fa1-4015-9d11-2a3cc719e6d1.png\" width=\"344\" height=\"314\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_35c1eaac-dc3c-44f3-bdac-807053535ad2.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"312\"></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">按鍵 3（按下 X）</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">召喚<strong>漩渦風暴</strong>，於<strong>3秒後</strong>啟動，造成傷害並<strong>將敵人推向空中</strong>，使其承受<strong>墜落傷害</strong>（冷卻時間：20秒）（注意：此技能有時會將你推向空中，解決方法是後退並啟動技能）且<strong>請謹慎使用...</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>守護者支配：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img style=\"color:#999\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_9f400312-d364-4c00-8654-b0a853f367b6.png\" width=\"252\" height=\"215\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_33812553-d3b1-4436-b418-5e490e275d6f.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"216\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_a8f66c10-98ef-47e5-b4da-a7d0db51003f.png\" width=\"495\" height=\"307\"></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">按鍵 4 + 按鍵 1（按下 H + 左鍵）</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 傳送至空中並重擊落地，造成高額傷害，並在你周圍生成虛空符文，<strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">如同終界守護者使用傳送重擊你</span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">（冷卻時間：40秒）</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>立即加入我們的 Discord！</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_88990236-7147-4c5a-892b-922548eef929.png\" width=\"172\" height=\"172\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
